<section class="section section-paper"><div class="container prose"><h2>Documentation should follow the procedure</h2><p>Identity documents, family-status evidence and supporting records should be checked for consistency before submission. The exact evidence depends on the route and the circumstances.</p><p><a href="/en/contact">Discuss the documents you already have →</a></p></div></section>
